# LeakSanitizer suppressions for the nightly sanitizers workflow (sanitizers.yml, LSAN_OPTIONS).
# Kept empty: a leak in porto-core or porto-io is a bug to fix, and a test that leaks on purpose
# is a test to fix (porto-szb.155 found one and fixed it). An entry needs a comment above it
# saying what it leaks, why that is deliberate or foreign, and the bead that removes it, for
# example:
#   # Deliberate: <thing> lives for the whole process (porto-xxx).
#   leak:<crate>::<function>
